    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 30,
      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive clinical and front staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "A large majority of reviewers describe Dr Alex Wargo and the clinic team as friendly, thorough, and welcoming. Pet owners value the unhurried consultations where medical options are explained clearly. A few clients noted occasional lapses in customer service or turnover at the reception desk, but overall sentiment regarding the staff remains very positive."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 19,
      "title": {
        "en": "Affectionate care for four-legged patients"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients consistently report that their pets receive sweet and mindful attention during visits. Reviewers note that staff take time to reassure nervous rescue dogs and comfort cats during exams or minor procedures. Pet parents appreciate that the team treats their animals with warmth and ensures a calm environment from check-in to checkout."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 10,
      "title": {
        "en": "Varied outcomes in grooming care"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many pet owners praise effective veterinary treatments for skin allergies, emergency surgeries, and tidy grooming cuts. However, a couple of reviewers experienced issues, including a cut paw during a grooming session and concerns during a diagnostic visit. While regular medical care is widely trusted, clients highlight occasional grooming inconsistencies."
      }
    }
  ],
